      "writtenOn": "2018-11-21T00:28:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if the same tag appear in the nested XML recursively. In that case, the same xml element will be parsed many times. \n\nFor example, TAG_COMPONENT2 will be parsed twice. \n \n\u003cTAG_COMPONENT1\u003e\n    \u003cTAG_COMPONENT2\u003e\n        \u003cTAG_COMPONENT3\u003e\n        \u003c/TAG_COMPONENT3\u003e\n    \u003c/TAG_COMPONENT2\u003e\n\u003c/TAG_COMPONENT1\u003e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 71
      },
      "revId": "353bc877fd21161643c54a4879db4fa2d659af11",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
